Package: atproto-pds-host
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, curl, ufw, unattended-upgrades, iproute2
Suggests: docker.io
Description: Ubuntu helpers for a self-hosted AT Protocol PDS
 Installs pds-host, a setup utility for hardening SSH/UFW and managing
 hostname files around Bluesky's official Personal Data Server installer.
 .
 This package does not install the PDS container, change firewall policy
 automatically, or run the upstream installer.
